---
import Layout from '../../../../layouts/Layout.astro';

const COMPASS_URL = 'https://redefiningretirement.io/products/the-gen-exit-compass';
---

<Layout
  title="You're In | Redefining Retirement"
  description="Your Gen eXit Playbook is on its way, plus a one-time $7 offer on The Gen eXit Compass."
  type="website"
  noindex={true}
  bare={true}
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container ty-container">
      <p class="ty-eyebrow">Thanks for signing up!</p>
      <h1 class="ty-headline">Your <strong>Gen eXit Playbook</strong> is on its way to your inbox right now.</h1>
      <p class="ty-subhead">I can't wait for you to dig in. But first, a quick question…</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section oto-section">
    <div class="container prose oto-prose">
      <span class="oto-badge">One-Time Offer:</span>
      <h2 class="oto-headline">Want My Gen eXit Compass for $7?</h2>

      <div class="cta-block oto-cta top-cta">
        <a class="btn btn-cta compass-cta-btn" href={COMPASS_URL} id="compass-cta-top">⚡ Get The Gen eXit Compass for $7</a>
        <p class="cta-trust">Use code PLAYBOOK7 in the cart.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="quiz-block">
        <p><strong>Pop quiz:</strong> What's the #1 most important thing for planning your next chapter in 2026?</p>
        <ul>
          <li>A) Maxing out your 401(k) and "saving harder"</li>
          <li>B) Polishing your résumé and updating LinkedIn</li>
          <li>C) Picking a hot side hustle everyone's talking about</li>
          <li>D) Just gutting it out until you're old enough to retire</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="quiz-answer"><strong>Answer:</strong> None of the above.</p>
      </div>

      <p>The #1 thing is <span class="highlight">finding a direction AI can't replace, and one you'd actually be glad to do for the rest of your working life</span>, before you build anything. That's the whole ballgame. The worst thing you can do is pour a year into the wrong thing and quit at month four.</p>

      <p class="intro-label">Introducing</p>
      <h3 class="intro-headline"><span class="product-badge">The Gen eXit Compass</span></h3>

      <img
        class="compass-cover"
        src="/images/compass/gen-exit-compass-cover.jpg"
        alt="The Gen eXit Compass workbook cover"
        loading="lazy"
      />

      <p>Inside, you'll discover:</p>

      <ul class="check-list">
        <li><strong>How to run your 25 years of experience through 7 plug-in AI prompts</strong> to surface a direction that's yours. No blank page, no guessing.</li>
        <li>The AI Rory Test, so you aim at the kind of work AI can't easily replace.</li>
        <li><strong>The Ikigai Intersection</strong>, where what you're good at, what you love, what's needed and what pays all meet.</li>
        <li>How to turn that direction into 3 real, demand-checked opportunities, ranked by which one you could test fastest.</li>
        <li>BONUS: Your fill-in "My North Star" page, so you walk away with an actual document, not a vague feeling.</li>
      </ul>

      <p>I've reinvented myself more than once: foundry worker, draftsman, and now a guy who gets paid on his own terms. I put the exact exercises and AI prompts I've used into a simple workbook you can finish in one sitting. Even if you have no idea what you'd do right now, and even if you've convinced yourself it's too late.</p>

      <div class="testimonial-block">
        <p>"Corey, this column may have saved my career. The AI Rory prompt helped put something in perspective for me about my new job and guided how I'm going to approach it going forward. I can't explain it without giving you a ton of detail, but I just wanted to say thank you!"</p>
        <span class="testimonial-attr">Andy Klungland</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="container">
      <div class="cta-block oto-cta">
        <h2>Grab it for $7 today</h2>
        <p class="price-line"><span class="price-was">$27</span> <span class="price-now">$7</span> with code <span class="promo-code">PLAYBOOK7</span></p>
        <p>Click "Add promotion code" in the cart and enter PLAYBOOK7.</p>
        <a class="btn btn-cta compass-cta-btn" href={COMPASS_URL} id="compass-cta-btn">⚡ Get The Gen eXit Compass for $7</a>
        <p>Not satisfied? Email <a href="mailto:coreysretirement@fastmail.com">coreysretirement@fastmail.com</a> and I'll refund you. No hassles, no questions.</p>
        <p class="cta-trust">30-Day Money-Back Guarantee. Secure checkout.</p>
      </div>
      <p class="no-thanks"><a href="https://redefiningretirement.io/">No thanks, I'll just check my inbox for the Playbook</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<script is:inline>
  (function () {
    window.dataLayer = window.dataLayer || [];

    // Fire on page load. This page is only reachable via Beehiiv signup redirect.
    // Used by Meta Pixel - Lead in GTM (avoids race condition with signedUp + redirect).
    window.dataLayer.push({ event: 'subscriber_signup_confirmed' });

    // Carry UTM + fbclid params through to the checkout link on BOTH buy buttons.
    var params = new URLSearchParams(window.location.search);
    var passthrough = new URLSearchParams();
    params.forEach(function (value, key) {
      if (key.indexOf('utm_') === 0 || key === 'fbclid' || key === 'gclid') {
        passthrough.append(key, value);
      }
    });

    document.querySelectorAll('.compass-cta-btn').forEach(function (btn) {
      if ([...passthrough].length) {
        var url = new URL(btn.href);
        passthrough.forEach(function (value, key) { url.searchParams.set(key, value); });
        btn.href = url.toString();
      }

      btn.addEventListener('click', function () {
        window.dataLayer.push({
          event: 'begin_checkout',
          ecommerce: {
            currency: 'USD',
            value: 7,
            items: [{ item_id: 'gen-exit-compass', item_name: 'The Gen eXit Compass', price: 7, quantity: 1 }],
          },
        });
      });
    });
  })();
</script>

<style>
  .code-callout {
    text-align: center;
    background: var(--bg-subtle);
    border: 2px dashed var(--blue);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    padding: 1.5rem;
    margin: 2rem 0;
  }

  .code-callout p {
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .code-callout-head {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .promo-code {
    display: inline-block;
    background: var(--blue);
    color: #ffffff;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    padding: 0.15rem 0.6rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius);
  }

  .ty-container {
    max-width: 720px;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .ty-eyebrow {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--blue);
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .ty-headline {
    font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 5vw, 2.6rem);
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .ty-subhead {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  .oto-section {
    padding-top: 0;
  }

  .oto-prose {
    max-width: 640px;
  }

  .oto-badge {
    display: block;
    width: fit-content;
    margin: 0 auto 0.75rem;
    background: var(--blue);
    color: #ffffff;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    padding: 0.4rem 1rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-pill);
  }

  .oto-headline {
    text-align: center;
    margin-top: 0 !important;
    font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 2.1rem);
  }

  .highlight {
    color: var(--blue);
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .quiz-block {
    background: var(--bg-subtle);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    padding: 1.5rem 1.5rem 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .quiz-block ul {
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .quiz-answer {
    margin-bottom: 0 !important;
  }

  .intro-label {
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem !important;
  }

  .intro-headline {
    text-align: center;
  }

  .product-badge {
    display: inline-block;
    background: var(--bg-subtle);
    border: 1px solid var(--blue);
    color: var(--text);
    padding: 0.4rem 1rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius);
  }

  .compass-cover {
    max-width: 280px;
    margin: 0 auto 1.5rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    box-shadow: 0 12px 30px -10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.25);
  }

  .check-list {
    list-style: none;
    padding-left: 0;
  }

  .check-list li {
    padding-left: 1.6rem;
    position: relative;
    margin-bottom: 0.85rem;
  }

  .check-list li::before {
    content: '✅';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    top: 0;
  }

  .price-reveal {
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 1.15rem;
  }

  .oto-cta {
    text-align: center;
  }

  .price-line {
    font-size: 1.6rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text);
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem !important;
  }

  .price-was {
    text-decoration: line-through;
    color: var(--text-light);
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    margin-right: 0.5rem;
  }

  .price-now {
    color: var(--blue);
  }

  .btn-cta {
    height: 56px;
    padding: 0 2rem;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .cta-trust {
    margin-top: 0.85rem !important;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--text-light);
  }

  .testimonial-block {
    padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;
    border-left: 4px solid var(--blue);
    background: var(--bg-subtle);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    margin: 2rem 0;
  }

  .testimonial-block p {
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: var(--text);
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .testimonial-attr {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  .top-cta {
    margin: 1.5rem 0 2rem;
  }

  .no-thanks {
    text-align: center;
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
  }

  .no-thanks a {
    color: var(--text-light);
  }
</style>
